# Reconnecting to the Host reads the open conversation again: a read that fails
# says so and keeps the draft, and the next reconnect clears the failure, brings
# the reply another client added meanwhile, and the draft sends. The connection
# switch in the environment settings disconnects and reconnects, as the
# iPhone's leaving and returning to the app does.
# iOS: testSimulatorReconnectClearsHistoryFailureAndPreservesDraft, testSimulatorKeepsOpenTaskAndFetchesLatestReplyAfterForeground
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press このプロジェクトで新しいチャット
type "AI に依頼する" "[immediate] 再接続の前に会話を始めます"
press 送信
expect "シミュレータで完了しました。" 30000
type "AI に依頼する" "Keep this retry draft"
fixture /fail-next-history-read
press 設定を開く
press 環境
press このPCへの接続
expect_absent 接続済み 10000
press このPCへの接続
expect 接続済み 20000
press 閉じる
expect "list_turns is not supported yet" 20000
expect "Keep this retry draft"
screenshot failed-read
fixture /background-reply
press 設定を開く
press 環境
press このPCへの接続
expect_absent 接続済み 10000
press このPCへの接続
expect 接続済み 20000
press 閉じる
expect "Latest reply from another client" 20000
expect_absent "list_turns is not supported yet"
expect "Keep this retry draft"
press 送信
# The conversation's rows read in their list's order, so the sent draft and
# its answer are counted rather than placed.
expect_absent "Keep this retry draft" after "AI に依頼する" 10000
expect "Keep this retry draft" 10000
expect_count "シミュレータで完了しました。" 2 30000
expect_absent "list_turns is not supported yet"
screenshot reconnected
